            "review_title": "Review at Lezzy House",
            "review_text": "Marc\nLondon, United Kingdom78 contributions\n0\nMy first cocktail experience in Saigon was truly unforgettable.\nJul 2026 • Couples\nThis modern and stylish hidden bar in the heart of the city made the evening even more special.\n\nAlthough we arrived quite late at night, the service was exceptionally warm and attentive throughout our visit. The atmosphere was relaxing, and the elegant black-themed interior created a sophisticated and luxurious ambiance.\n\nWe ordered cocktails that were not listed on the menu based on our personal preferences \"LONG ISAND ICE TEA\", and the bartender crafted them perfectly. The drinks were excellent, beautifully presented, and well worth the price. A special thanks to Mr. Long, the bartender, who took great care of us and made our experience even more memorable with his professionalism and hospitality.\n\nI highly recommend this bar to anyone who loves drinking cocktails and is looking for a luxurious yet reasonably priced place to enjoy an evening in Saigon. It's definitely a hidden gem that cocktail lovers should not miss.\nRead more\nWritten July 31, 2026",
