            "review_title": "Review at Lezzy House",
            "review_text": "Алексей\n3 contributions\n1\nBest hookah spot in Ho Chi Minh City\nMar 2025 • Solo\nI happened to walk into Lezzy House Bar at 92 Đề Thám Street – I never expected to find such an atmospheric place in Saigon with normal shisha prices.\nTook a hookah for 592k, taste and serve - just\nThe next day he came back in the afternoon, at 4 o'clock - hit happy hour, discounted. The staff are very friendly, explained everything, helped to choose the taste.\nThe bar itself is very stylish, has its own mood. Cool place, I recommend it!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten April 13, 2025\nLezzy - A HOUSE OF SHISHA & COCKTAIL\nThank you for stopping by and for taking the time to leave such a lovely review! We're glad you enjoyed the shisha, the atmosphere, and our Happy Hour. Our team will be happy to hear your kind words.\n\nWe can't wait to welcome you back to Lezzy House for another relaxing evening. See you again soon!\nRead more\nWritten June 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
